<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns"><key id="type" for="all" attr.name="type" attr.type="string" /><key id="label" for="all" attr.name="label" attr.type="string" /><key id="provenance" for="all" attr.name="provenance" attr.type="string" /><key id="relation" for="all" attr.name="relation" attr.type="string" /><graph id="literal_usage_and_dependency" edgedefault="directed"><node id="s:SAT:L9:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">本稿は、知の成立条件を、境界・履歴・内部ヒューリスティック・外部ヒューリスティック・同期・照合・残差保持・再照合可能性から再定義するための基幹命題列である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L9</data></node><node id="t:照合"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">照合</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e0" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:内部ヒューリスティック"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">内部ヒューリスティック</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e1" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:内部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:再照合可能性"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">再照合可能性</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e2" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:再照合可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:同期"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">同期</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e3" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:境界"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">境界</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e4" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">外部ヒューリスティック</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e5" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:履歴"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">履歴</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e6" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:履歴"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:条件"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">条件</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e7" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:条件"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:残差保持"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">残差保持</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e8" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:残差保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:知"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">知</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e9" source="s:SAT:L9:C0" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L11:C14"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">既存思想との接続は、権威づけではなく照合のために注解ファイルへ置く。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L11</data></node><edge id="e10" source="s:SAT:L11:C14" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:0.2:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">知とは、履歴を持つ存在が、外部からの入力を受け取り、内部で処理し、外部と同期し、その一致・不一致・残差を照合し、なお閉じきれないものを保持しながら、次の判断可能性を維持することで成立する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L21</data></node><edge id="e11" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:一致"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">一致</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e12" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:不一致"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">不一致</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e13" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:保持"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">保持</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e14" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:判断可能性"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">判断可能性</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e15" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:判断可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e16" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e17" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:履歴"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:残差"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">残差</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e18" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e19" source="s:SAT:0.2:C4" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:0.3:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">認識とは、境界において、内部ヒューリスティックと外部ヒューリスティックが接触し、同期し、照合され、残差を残しながら更新される過程である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L27</data></node><edge id="e20" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e21" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:内部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e22" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e23" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e24" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:接触"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">接触</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e25" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:接触"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:更新"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">更新</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e26" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:更新"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e27" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:認識"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">認識</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e28" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:認識"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:過程"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">過程</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e29" source="s:SAT:0.3:C4" target="t:過程"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">境界認識批判は、有限観測系において、観測・分類・同期・照合から漏れるものを、どのように残差として保持し、再照合可能性を維持するかを問う。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L35</data></node><edge id="e30" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e31" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e32" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:再照合可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:分類"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">分類</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e33" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e34" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e35" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:批判"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">批判</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e36" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:批判"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e37" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:観測"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">観測</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e38" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:観測"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e39" source="s:SAT:0.3.3:C6" target="t:認識"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:5.8.2:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">理性の暴走とは、内部ループの閉鎖欲が、外部同期と照合を失った状態である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L203</data></node><edge id="e40" source="s:SAT:5.8.2:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e41" source="s:SAT:5.8.2:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:理性の暴走"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">理性の暴走</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e42" source="s:SAT:5.8.2:C6" target="t:理性の暴走"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:閉鎖"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">閉鎖</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e43" source="s:SAT:5.8.2:C6" target="t:閉鎖"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:7.4:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">したがって、同期には照合が必要である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L273</data></node><edge id="e44" source="s:SAT:7.4:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e45" source="s:SAT:7.4:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合とは、同期の成否だけでなく、一致・不一致・残差が何を意味するかを読む操作である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L283</data></node><edge id="e46" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e47" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e48" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e49" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:意味"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">意味</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e50" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:操作"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">操作</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e51" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:操作"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e52" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.2:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合は、単なる比較ではない。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L285</data></node><edge id="e53" source="s:SAT:8.2:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:比較"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">比較</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e54" source="s:SAT:8.2:C4" target="t:比較"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.3:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合は、どの履歴場において、どの外部ヒューリスティックと、どの条件で一致しているのかを問う。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L287</data></node><edge id="e55" source="s:SAT:8.3:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e56" source="s:SAT:8.3:C4" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e57" source="s:SAT:8.3:C4" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:履歴場"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">履歴場</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e58" source="s:SAT:8.3:C4" target="t:履歴場"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e59" source="s:SAT:8.3:C4" target="t:条件"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.4:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合は、不一致を単純な誤りとして即時に捨てない。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L289</data></node><edge id="e60" source="s:SAT:8.4:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e61" source="s:SAT:8.4:C4" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.6:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合は、残差を意味の資源として保持する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L307</data></node><edge id="e62" source="s:SAT:8.6:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e63" source="s:SAT:8.6:C4" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e64" source="s:SAT:8.6:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e65" source="s:SAT:8.6:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.7:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合だけを絶対化すると、すべての残差を何らかの意味として閉じようとする。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L309</data></node><edge id="e66" source="s:SAT:8.7:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e67" source="s:SAT:8.7:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e68" source="s:SAT:8.7:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:8.8:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合の過剰は、残差保持ではなく、残差の意味強制になる。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L311</data></node><edge id="e69" source="s:SAT:8.8:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e70" source="s:SAT:8.8:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e71" source="s:SAT:8.8:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e72" source="s:SAT:8.8:C4" target="t:残差保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.1:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">知は、同期と照合だけでは閉じない。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L317</data></node><edge id="e73" source="s:SAT:9.1:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e74" source="s:SAT:9.1:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e75" source="s:SAT:9.1:C4" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.3:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合は、その一致・不一致・残差に意味を与える。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L321</data></node><edge id="e76" source="s:SAT:9.3:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e77" source="s:SAT:9.3:C4" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e78" source="s:SAT:9.3:C4" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e79" source="s:SAT:9.3:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e80" source="s:SAT:9.3:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.4:C4"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">しかし、照合されたもののすべてが閉じられるわけではない。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L323</data></node><edge id="e81" source="s:SAT:9.4:C4" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">残差とは、同期・照合・分類・観測の過程で現れる、まだ再照合可能な差分である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L329</data></node><edge id="e82" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:再照合"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">再照合</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e83" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e84" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e85" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e86" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e87" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:観測"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e88" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:過程"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">残差は、現在の同期体系では照合不能な意味張力である場合がある。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L347</data></node><edge id="e89" source="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e90" source="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e91" source="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e92" source="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:照合不能"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">照合不能</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e93" source="s:SAT:9.6.5:C6" target="t:照合不能"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.11:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">新しいヒューリスティックは、しばしば残差保持と再照合の結果として発生する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L357</data></node><edge id="e94" source="s:SAT:9.11:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><node id="t:ヒューリスティック"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">ヒューリスティック</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e95" source="s:SAT:9.11:C5" target="t:ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e96" source="s:SAT:9.11:C5" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e97" source="s:SAT:9.11:C5" target="t:残差保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">創発とは、無からの出現ではなく、既存の分類体系で閉じられなかった残差が、再照合によって新しい分類形式を要求することである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L359</data></node><edge id="e98" source="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e99" source="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e100" source="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:創発"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">創発</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e101" source="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7" target="t:創発"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e102" source="s:SAT:9.11.1:C7" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.12.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">嘘とは、照合経路を切断し、残差へのアクセスを塞ぐ操作である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L363</data></node><edge id="e103" source="s:SAT:9.12.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:嘘"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">嘘</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e104" source="s:SAT:9.12.1:C7" target="t:嘘"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e105" source="s:SAT:9.12.1:C7" target="t:操作"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e106" source="s:SAT:9.12.1:C7" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">真とは、ある命題が、特定の履歴場において、特定の外部ヒューリスティックと照合され、判断可能性を保つ状態である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L401</data></node><edge id="e107" source="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e108" source="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7" target="t:判断可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e109" source="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e110" source="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7" target="t:履歴場"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:真"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">真</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e111" source="s:SAT:10.5.1:C7" target="t:真"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">偽とは、同期不能、照合不能、適用範囲逸脱、分類失敗、または偽閉鎖として現れる。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L405</data></node><edge id="e112" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><node id="t:偽"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">偽</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e113" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:偽"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:偽閉鎖"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">偽閉鎖</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e114" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:偽閉鎖"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e115" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e116" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e117" source="s:SAT:10.6.1:C7" target="t:照合不能"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:10.7.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">未解決とは、照合が閉じていない状態である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L409</data></node><edge id="e118" source="s:SAT:10.7.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:未解決"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">未解決</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e119" source="s:SAT:10.7.1:C7" target="t:未解決"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、同期の一致・不一致・残差を照合する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L425</data></node><edge id="e120" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e121" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e122" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e123" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:学問"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">学問</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e124" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e125" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.1:C9" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.2.1.2:C9"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、その照合手順を言語化する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L427</data></node><edge id="e126" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.2:C9" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e127" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.2:C9" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:照合手順"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">照合手順</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e128" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.2:C9" target="t:照合手順"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.2.1.3:C9"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、その照合手順を記号化する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L429</data></node><edge id="e129" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.3:C9" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e130" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.3:C9" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e131" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.3:C9" target="t:照合手順"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.2.1.4:C9"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、その照合手順を方法化する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L431</data></node><edge id="e132" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.4:C9" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e133" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.4:C9" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e134" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.4:C9" target="t:照合手順"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.2.1.5:C9"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、その照合手順を他者が再照合できる形へ保存する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L433</data></node><edge id="e135" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.5:C9" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e136" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.5:C9" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e137" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.5:C9" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e138" source="s:SAT:11.2.1.5:C9" target="t:照合手順"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.3:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">したがって、学問とは、同期と照合の継承可能な形式である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L435</data></node><edge id="e139" source="s:SAT:11.3:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:したがって、学問"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">したがって、学問</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e140" source="s:SAT:11.3:C5" target="t:したがって、学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e141" source="s:SAT:11.3:C5" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.3.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">科学は、外部同期と再照合の強度が高い学問形式である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L437</data></node><edge id="e142" source="s:SAT:11.3.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e143" source="s:SAT:11.3.1:C7" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e144" source="s:SAT:11.3.1:C7" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e145" source="s:SAT:11.3.1:C7" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.3.2:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">哲学は、同期と照合の成立条件そのものを問う学問形式である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L439</data></node><edge id="e146" source="s:SAT:11.3.2:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e147" source="s:SAT:11.3.2:C7" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e148" source="s:SAT:11.3.2:C7" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e149" source="s:SAT:11.3.2:C7" target="t:条件"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">人文学は、履歴場における意味・解釈・言語ゲーム・価値の照合を扱う学問形式である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L443</data></node><edge id="e150" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e151" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e152" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:履歴場"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e153" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:解釈"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">解釈</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e154" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:解釈"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">言語ゲーム</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e155" source="s:SAT:11.3.4:C7" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.4:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">AI時代の学問は、外部記憶を内部理解へ同期し、その照合過程を人間が保持できるかを問われる。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L445</data></node><edge id="e156" source="s:SAT:11.4:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e157" source="s:SAT:11.4:C5" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e158" source="s:SAT:11.4:C5" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e159" source="s:SAT:11.4:C5" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e160" source="s:SAT:11.4:C5" target="t:過程"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:11.5.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、残差を再照合可能な形で保存し、未来の問いへ渡すための制度である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L449</data></node><edge id="e161" source="s:SAT:11.5.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e162" source="s:SAT:11.5.1:C7" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e163" source="s:SAT:11.5.1:C7" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e164" source="s:SAT:11.5.1:C7" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.6:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">言語ゲームとは、共同体内で安定化した照合規則である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L465</data></node><edge id="e165" source="s:SAT:12.6:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><node id="t:照合規則"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">照合規則</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e166" source="s:SAT:12.6:C5" target="t:照合規則"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e167" source="s:SAT:12.6:C5" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.8.1:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">誤解は、照合規則の不一致として発生する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L471</data></node><edge id="e168" source="s:SAT:12.8.1:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e169" source="s:SAT:12.8.1:C7" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e170" source="s:SAT:12.8.1:C7" target="t:照合規則"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.9:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">通約とは、異なる言語ゲームの間に照合可能な対応面を作ることである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L473</data></node><edge id="e171" source="s:SAT:12.9:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e172" source="s:SAT:12.9:C5" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:通約"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">通約</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e173" source="s:SAT:12.9:C5" target="t:通約"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.9.3:C7"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">通約とは、差異を消すことではなく、照合可能な境界面を作ることである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L479</data></node><edge id="e174" source="s:SAT:12.9.3:C7" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e175" source="s:SAT:12.9.3:C7" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e176" source="s:SAT:12.9.3:C7" target="t:通約"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.10:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">言語ゲームの失敗は、残差を非常識・非合理・非存在として処分し、照合可能性を失わせることである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L481</data></node><edge id="e177" source="s:SAT:12.10:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e178" source="s:SAT:12.10:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e179" source="s:SAT:12.10:C6" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:12.10.1:C8"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">残差をユーモアとして処理する、または誤解や誤謬として扱う場合には、照合の可能性が残される。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L483</data></node><edge id="e180" source="s:SAT:12.10.1:C8" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e181" source="s:SAT:12.10.1:C8" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:13.7:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">AIを外部ヒューリスティックとして使い、内部理解と照合するなら、判断可能性は増える。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L501</data></node><edge id="e182" source="s:SAT:13.7:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e183" source="s:SAT:13.7:C5" target="t:判断可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e184" source="s:SAT:13.7:C5" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:13.10.1:C8"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">AI時代の批判哲学は、AIによって増幅された外部ヒューリスティックを、内部理解とどう同期し、どう照合するかを問うことである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L513</data></node><edge id="e185" source="s:SAT:13.10.1:C8" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e186" source="s:SAT:13.10.1:C8" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e187" source="s:SAT:13.10.1:C8" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e188" source="s:SAT:13.10.1:C8" target="t:批判"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:14.14:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">照合だけを絶対化する態度は、残差を無理に閉じる。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L551</data></node><edge id="e189" source="s:SAT:14.14:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e190" source="s:SAT:14.14:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:14.15:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">同期も照合も捨てる態度は、残差を氾濫させる。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L553</data></node><edge id="e191" source="s:SAT:14.15:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e192" source="s:SAT:14.15:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e193" source="s:SAT:14.15:C6" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.2:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">知は、その同期の一致・不一致・残差を照合することで意味を持つ。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L581</data></node><edge id="e194" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e195" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e196" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e197" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e198" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e199" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e200" source="s:SAT:15.2:C5" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.3:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">知は、残差を保持し、再照合可能性を維持することで更新可能性を持つ。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L583</data></node><edge id="e201" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e202" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e203" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:再照合可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e204" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:更新"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e205" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e206" source="s:SAT:15.3:C5" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.9:C5"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">学問は、同期と照合を再照合可能な形へ保存する営みである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L595</data></node><edge id="e207" source="s:SAT:15.9:C5" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e208" source="s:SAT:15.9:C5" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e209" source="s:SAT:15.9:C5" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e210" source="s:SAT:15.9:C5" target="t:学問"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.10:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">言語ゲームは、共同体における照合規則である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L597</data></node><edge id="e211" source="s:SAT:15.10:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e212" source="s:SAT:15.10:C6" target="t:照合規則"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e213" source="s:SAT:15.10:C6" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">知るとは、境界で接触し、同期し、照合し、残差を保持しながら、次の判断可能性を開くことである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L605</data></node><edge id="e214" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e215" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e216" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:判断可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e217" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e218" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e219" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:接触"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e220" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:知る"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">知る</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e221" source="s:SAT:15.12.1:C8" target="t:知る"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:15.13:C6"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">有限な観測者にとって、現在の到達は完成ではなく、再照合可能な仮閉鎖である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L607</data></node><edge id="e222" source="s:SAT:15.13:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e223" source="s:SAT:15.13:C6" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e224" source="s:SAT:15.13:C6" target="t:観測"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e225" source="s:SAT:15.13:C6" target="t:閉鎖"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L615:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">A.2　本稿は、知の成立条件を、境界・履歴・同期・照合・残差保持から再定義する試みである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L615</data></node><edge id="e226" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e227" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e228" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e229" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:履歴"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e230" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:条件"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e231" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:残差保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e232" source="s:SAT:L615:C0" target="t:知"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L617:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">A.3　既存思想との接続は、本稿の権威づけではなく、未踏領域を主張しないための照合である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L617</data></node><edge id="e233" source="s:SAT:L617:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L623:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">A.6　本文の骨格は、境界・履歴・内部ヒューリスティック・外部ヒューリスティック・同期・照合・残差保持である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L623</data></node><edge id="e234" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e235" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:内部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e236" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e237" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:境界"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e238" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e239" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:履歴"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e240" source="s:SAT:L623:C0" target="t:残差保持"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L662:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">注意: 残差は、同期・照合・分類・観測の過程で現れる、まだ再照合可能な差分である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L662</data></node><edge id="e241" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e242" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e243" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e244" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e245" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e246" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:観測"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e247" source="s:SAT:L662:C0" target="t:過程"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L699:C35"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">履歴を原料として、受容・分類・判断・閉鎖・再照合を可能にする構造である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L699</data></node><edge id="e248" source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e249" source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e250" source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e251" source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:履歴"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e252" source="s:SAT:L699:C35" target="t:閉鎖"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L729:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">補足: 意味圧とは、未閉鎖の gap や残差が、既存の closure に似た構造を要求し、解釈・分類・補完・再照合を促す圧である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L729</data></node><edge id="e253" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">compound_surface_overlap</data></edge><edge id="e254" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e255" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e256" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:補足: 意味圧"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">補足: 意味圧</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e257" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:補足: 意味圧"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e258" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:解釈"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e259" source="s:SAT:L729:C0" target="t:閉鎖"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L749:C44"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">異なる言語ゲーム、パラダイム、履歴場の間に、照合可能な対応面を作ることである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L749</data></node><edge id="e260" source="s:SAT:L749:C44" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e261" source="s:SAT:L749:C44" target="t:履歴場"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e262" source="s:SAT:L749:C44" target="t:言語ゲーム"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L762:C0"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">補足: 再照合可能性とは、一度閉じた命題・判断・分類・制度的処理を、残差や残渣へのアクセス経路を保ったまま、再び照合可能にする条件である。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L762</data></node><edge id="e263" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e264" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e265" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:条件"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e266" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:残渣"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">残渣</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e267" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:残渣"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="t:補足: 再照合可能性"><data key="type">term</data><data key="label">補足: 再照合可能性</data><data key="provenance" /></node><edge id="e268" source="s:SAT:L762:C0" target="t:補足: 再照合可能性"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:L766:C50"><data key="type">sentence</data><data key="label">意味に不一致がある場合は、日本語正本と定義所有文書へ戻って照合する。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L766</data></node><edge id="e269" source="s:SAT:L766:C50" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">direct_surface_use_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e270" source="s:SAT:L766:C50" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e271" source="s:SAT:L766:C50" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">same_sentence_usage_not_inference</data></edge><edge id="e272" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e273" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:一致"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e274" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e275" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:不一致"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e276" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e277" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e278" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e279" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:意味"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e280" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e281" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:操作"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e282" source="t:照合" target="s:SAT:8.1:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e283" source="s:SAT:8.1:C4" target="t:残差"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:7.3:C4"><data key="type">definition_sentence</data><data key="label">同期とは、内部ヒューリスティックと外部ヒューリスティックが、運用上安定して対応することである。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L255</data></node><edge id="e284" source="t:同期" target="s:SAT:7.3:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e285" source="s:SAT:7.3:C4" target="t:内部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e286" source="t:同期" target="s:SAT:7.3:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e287" source="s:SAT:7.3:C4" target="t:外部ヒューリスティック"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><node id="s:SAT:9.5:C4"><data key="type">definition_sentence</data><data key="label">残差とは、単なる未解決問題ではない。</data><data key="provenance">01_Sat_Truth/Boundary_Epistemological_Critique.ja.md:L327</data></node><edge id="e288" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5:C4"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e289" source="s:SAT:9.5:C4" target="t:未解決"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e290" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e291" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:再照合"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e292" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e293" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:分類"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e294" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e295" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:同期"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e296" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e297" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:照合"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e298" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e299" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:観測"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge><edge id="e300" source="t:残差" target="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6"><data key="relation">candidate_definition_statement</data></edge><edge id="e301" source="s:SAT:9.5.1:C6" target="t:過程"><data key="relation">literal_reference_in_definition_not_entailment</data></edge></graph></graphml>
